      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil ANTT Minimum Freight Calculator & CT-e XML Batch Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nCalculates the mandatory Brazilian ANTT minimum road freight floor (Lei 13.703/2018 - CCD x km + CC) and audits CT-e 4.00 XML invoices in batch to prevent automatic ANTT/SEFAZ fines.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-antt-freight-cte-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-antt-freight-cte-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-antt-freight-cte-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "18855aeb-e41b-5726-bc6d-1260e72d6c88",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "fcd3d8e8-f96f-5c10-9c8e-1b3419453fa4",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
